OL,4,CHow Ceefax switches to digital TV      
OL,5, Experiments have been conducted by NMS 
OL,6, B&PD which have shown it is possible to
OL,7, transmit NMPTV as a DVB-T multiplex.   
OL,9,FHowever, due to capital and operational
OL,10,Fexpense concerns, there are no plans to
OL,11,Fmake this service available to users.  
OL,13,FThere is no getting around the fact    
OL,14,Fthat digital modulators are expensive  
OL,15,Fand often power-hungry compared to     
OL,16,Ftheir analogue equivalents.            
OL,18,FWe are using this new knowledge to     
OL,19,Fimprove our distribution network, which
OL,20,Fmeans better quality than ever before. 
